<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>io.github.moooossee.Moose</id>
  <name>Moose</name>
  <summary>Chat with local and cloud AI</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.moooossee">
    <name>moooossee</name>
  </developer>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>GPL-3.0-or-later</project_license>
  <description>
    <p>Ask questions, work on your writing or get help with code. Chat with AI running on your computer through Ollama, or use an online service such as OpenRouter with your own key. Browse models for the things you want to do, or download compatible models from Hugging Face.</p>
    <p>Bring photos, PDFs and text files into the conversation. In Files, you can find your attachments, preview documents, search your library and return to related chats. Answers can show passages from your documents so you can check where information came from. Pictures need a model that can understand them, and PDFs need text you can select.</p>
    <p>Edit a message, try a different answer or go back to an earlier version. If an answer reaches its limit, you can ask it to continue. Drafts save as you go, and code and math are formatted to make them easier to read.</p>
    <p>When you want to look something up or check a calculation, turn on Web or Calculator with a compatible Ollama or Ollama Cloud model. You can read the sources and see what the tools did alongside the answer.</p>
    <p>Your chats, drafts and document library are saved on your device. You decide whether messages or files can be shared with an online service, with separate permissions you can reset in Privacy settings. Web asks for its own permission: search services receive your searches, websites receive requests for the pages you read, and results are shared with the model answering your chat. Each service's privacy policy applies to what you share. Local Only uses only Ollama managed by Moose and turns off web tools. Keys for online services are kept in your desktop's secure key storage.</p>
  </description>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>AI</keyword>
    <keyword>Artificial intelligence</keyword>
    <keyword>Local AI</keyword>
    <keyword>Cloud AI</keyword>
    <keyword>Ollama</keyword>
    <keyword>OpenRouter</keyword>
    <keyword>Hugging Face</keyword>
    <keyword>GGUF</keyword>
    <keyword>LLM</keyword>
    <keyword>Chatbot</keyword>
    <keyword>Models</keyword>
    <keyword>PDF</keyword>
    <keyword>Documents</keyword>
    <keyword>Vision</keyword>
    <keyword>Reasoning</keyword>
    <keyword>Web search</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.moooossee.Moose.desktop</launchable>
  <url type="homepage">https://moooossee.github.io/</url>
  <url type="bugtracker">https://github.com/moooossee/moose/issues</url>
  <url type="vcs-browser">https://github.com/moooossee/moose</url>
  <url type="contribute">https://github.com/moooossee/moose</url>
  <branding>
    <color type="primary" scheme_preference="light">#7db7b3</color>
    <color type="primary" scheme_preference="dark">#24504d</color>
  </branding>
